# TATR @package_version@ alpha

Platform: @platform@. Built with @package_compiler@.
Runtime requirements: @runtime@.
Source revision: @SOURCE_REVISION@.

This is an experimental alpha. The Linux archive targets Alpine 3.21 x64/musl;
it is not a universal Linux/glibc binary. macOS and other architectures are unverified.

Extract the entire archive. Run `bin/tatr --version` (Windows:
`.\bin\tatr.exe --version`), or add bin to PATH. Preserve both MIT notices under
share/tatr/licenses when redistributing. TATR itself needs no compiler or CMake;
the included demonstration deliberately uses CMake 3.25+ as its external program.

From the extracted package directory, with CMake on PATH:

```sh
./bin/tatr --file examples/tatr.toml list
./bin/tatr --file examples/tatr.toml plan hello
./bin/tatr --file examples/tatr.toml run hello
```

On Windows PowerShell use `.\bin\tatr.exe` for the executable above.
The example explicitly loads a public .env.example file, checks its value in a
CMake script, and writes TATR action records to stderr and logs/example-{date}.log.
Child output stays on the console. No private .env file is included or discovered.
The package directory must be writable for this example's log directory; adjust
logging.file.directory or remove its table when using a read-only installation.

TATR runs argument arrays directly, in dependency order, stopping at the first
failure. Task cwd/env_file and log directory paths resolve from the TOML directory.
Use `--file` to select a config; there is no parent-directory discovery.
Exit codes: 0 success, 1 failed child, 2 CLI/configuration/runner/logging error.
There is no implicit shell, timeout, process-tree cleanup, parallel execution,
child-output capture or log rotation/retention. Log records omit argument arrays
and environment values, but task names/diagnostic paths can expose project metadata.

MANIFEST.json records the build and SHA-256 hashes of the seven payload files.
The release's SHA256SUMS file records the archive hashes.

Source and full documentation:
https://gitlab.com/wqyeo/thats-another-task-runner/-/tree/@package_version@
